"Mokauea Island", "Honolulu County (Oʻahu)",
"Morris Point", "Maui County (Maui, Molokaʻi, Lānaʻi)",
"Moʻomomi", "Maui County (Maui, Molokaʻi, Lānaʻi)",
"Māhāʻulepū", "Kauaʻi County",
"Māʻili Beach", "Honolulu County (Oʻahu)",
"Nukoliʻi", "Kauaʻi County",
"Nāpili Bay", "Maui County (Maui, Molokaʻi, Lānaʻi)",
"Old Airport", "Hawaiʻi County",
"Onekahakaha", "Hawaiʻi County",
